    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir36">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e98">Caput 36</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir36-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_1@1-2">Miserere nostri.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir36-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir36-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e113">Ex persona fidelium dirigit orationem ad Deum, ut illos defendat et inimicos deprimat, ut digne correcti Deum iterum agnoscant, et idola deserant.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir36-Dd1e117">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e119">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e121">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e123" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_7@1-2">Glorifica manum,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir36-Rd1e126"><name xml:id="gom-sir36-Nd1e127" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e130">Optat, ut divina majestas per manum et dextrum brachium, id est, per Christum, per quem antiqua miracula facta sunt, innovet tempore gratiae, ut veteris legis et novae idem intelligatur esse Deus.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir36-Dd1e134">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e136">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e138">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1219A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e142" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_15">Extolle adversarium,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir36-Rd1e147"><name xml:id="gom-sir36-Nd1e148" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e151"><seg type="qs">Significat per adventum Christi</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">pro statu Ecclesiae et fidelium salute.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir36-Dd1e160">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e162">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e164">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e166" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_16@2-2">Sion,</quote>
            etc. Notitia Scripturae, in qua praedicatur inenarrabilis virtus Dei.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir36-Dd1e172">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e174">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e176">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e178" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_17@9-10">Et suscita,</quote>
            etc., Omnes prophetae incarnationi Christi dant testimonium, quod Deus homo factus Ecclesiam sibi desponsaret.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir36-Dd1e183">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e185">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e187">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e189" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_19@1-2">Secundum benedictionem,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir36-Rd1e192"><name xml:id="gom-sir36-Nd1e193" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e196"><seg type="qs">Ordinem scilicet, et ritum sacerdotii</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quod Aaron figuravit in temporalibus sacrificiis, hoc impleat in spiritualibus Evangelii.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir36-Dd1e205">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e207">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e209">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e211" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_20@1-2">Omnem escam.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir36-Rd1e214"><name xml:id="gom-sir36-Nd1e215" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e218"><seg type="qs">Postquam praedixit vocationem gentium</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sic veracem doctrinam discernamus, et fallacem.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir36-Dd1e227">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e229">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e231">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1219B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e235" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_24@1-2">Species mulieris.</quote>
            Christi gratia, quae per praedicationem animas curat, et carnis concupiscentiam mitigat. Haec in Ecclesia abundat, cujus desiderium est super omnem concupiscentiam hominis, quia in ea decor virtutum et pulchritudo doctrinae.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e239">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e241" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_24@8-9">Super omnem.</quote>
            Nulla concupiscentia hominis huic desiderio potest comparari: quia, <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e244" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov31_30@2-12">Fallax gratia et vana est pulchritudo; mulier timens Deum ipsa laudabitur</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir36-Dd1e249">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e251">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e253">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e255" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_25@8-10">Non est vir.</quote>
            Christus qui excedit humanam naturam. Unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e258" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps44_3@1-5">Speciosus forma prae filiis hominum</quote>. Hic enim peccatum non fecit, nec est inventus dolus in ore ejus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir36-Dd1e263">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e265">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e267">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e269" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_26@6-6">Adjutorium.</quote>
            Adjutorium Ecclesiae est secundum dispensationem Christi. Unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e272" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps7_11@1-5">Justum adjutorium <pb ed="#P" n="1219C"/> meum a Domino</quote>, etc. Ipse est infinitatis ejus columna, et laboris requies.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir36-Dd1e280">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir36-Hd1e282">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir36-d1e284">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e286" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir36_28@3-6">Qui non habet nidum.</quote>
            Id est, Ecclesiam, ubi electorum animae filios bonorum operum nutriunt. Unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir36-Qd1e289" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps83_4@3-13">Invenit sibi passer domum, et turtur nidum, ubi reponat pullos suos.</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
